OL,3,AVillage vote 'sent powerful message',
OL,4,Asay politicians
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal politicians have called on the
OL,7,Fgovernment to take notice of a
OL,8,Freferendum held in the village of
OL,9,FBarnham and re-think its plans for
OL,10,Fhousing asylum seekers nearby.
OL,12,FNinety-four percent of the 274 people
OL,13,Fwho took part voted to become
OL,14,Findependent of the United Kingdom as a
OL,15,Fway of protesting against a proposal to
OL,16,Fhouse migrants at the former RAF
OL,17,FBarnham military base.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
